  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOSTAN 2002</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TOSTAN 2002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tostan is in the process of implementing a modified method in its human rights education - which aims at i.a. inspiring village by village to abandon dangerous traditional practices such as femal genital mutilation and child marriages. The method may need some further fine-tuning before it is to be disseminated in West Africa through the education center of Tostan in Thies, Senegal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tostan ska i Senegal till&#xe4;mpa en modifierad metod av sin  mr-utbildning som bl a syftar till att hela byar &#xe5;t g&#xe5;ngen upph&#xf6;r med skadliga sedv&#xe4;njor s&#xe5;som k&#xf6;nsstympning och barn&#xe4;ktenskap. Metoden kommer efter ev finslipningar att d&#xe4;refter spridas i V&#xe4;stafrika via Tostans utbildningscenter i Thies, Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
